WEBVTT

00:12.000 --> 00:14.560
♪Trapped in this tiny world♪

00:15.040 --> 00:18.440
♪I'm crushed into dust♪

00:19.200 --> 00:23.000
♪I meddle around without any mercy♪

00:23.320 --> 00:26.160
♪I'm my own pawn♪

00:26.520 --> 00:30.360
♪I sigh at my fate♪

00:30.560 --> 00:35.360
♪Numerous people are under my control♪

00:38.040 --> 00:41.880
♪All the sand is washed away♪

00:44.280 --> 00:47.880
♪An old dream fades♪

00:50.200 --> 00:54.560
♪A bumpy path lies ahead♪

00:56.040 --> 00:58.880
♪Traps within traps,
I never make mistakes♪

00:59.200 --> 01:02.000
♪I take a risk at every step♪

01:02.280 --> 01:07.400
♪Even in disputes,
I break through with my life♪

01:07.880 --> 01:10.280
♪Schemes within schemes,
I prison myself♪

01:10.520 --> 01:13.600
♪Each link swaps bluff and truth♪

01:13.920 --> 01:16.480
♪The world is my Weiqi game board♪

01:16.800 --> 01:22.120
♪Everything's just fleeting♪

01:23.720 --> 01:28.320
♪The play begins♪

01:30.280 --> 01:32.520
♪No return is expected♪

01:32.880 --> 01:37.880
♪The flame is gone,
whether we win or lose♪

01:38.280 --> 01:40.360
♪The wind never ceases.
I hold the reins♪

01:40.360 --> 01:41.480
[Ashes To Crown]

01:41.480 --> 01:45.680
[Adapted from Xixing's novel,
Empress of the State of Chu]

01:46.470 --> 01:49.000
[Episode 9]

01:49.060 --> 01:50.460
Tie Ying commands an elite squad

01:50.860 --> 01:51.540
of covert warfare.

01:52.540 --> 01:53.580
Night raid on Wuyang Pass,

01:54.020 --> 01:54.900
fire on Panying Pass,

01:55.340 --> 01:56.220
and massacre at Qingshi Stronghold.

01:57.340 --> 01:58.420
They've never failed.

02:00.180 --> 02:02.020
I've heard about this squad.

02:02.820 --> 02:03.820
They always strike

02:04.180 --> 02:05.500
on dark, windy nights,

02:06.060 --> 02:07.420
slaying all who stand in their way.

02:08.260 --> 02:09.580
In that case,

02:10.460 --> 02:11.460
I don't think

02:11.900 --> 02:12.940
we're likely to win.

02:16.980 --> 02:17.780
Not really.

02:17.980 --> 02:18.620
This squad

02:18.620 --> 02:19.820
excels at night raids

02:19.900 --> 02:22.220
because they have superb hearing.

02:23.180 --> 02:24.380
That's why they can move freely

02:24.380 --> 02:25.420
in the darkness.

02:27.980 --> 02:29.260
There's a way.

02:29.980 --> 02:30.820
We can set traps

02:30.820 --> 02:31.780
in the bamboo forest

02:32.220 --> 02:33.460
and catch them off guard.

02:34.020 --> 02:35.580
Then we'll shoot them from the shadows.

02:36.860 --> 02:37.420
Then,

02:38.460 --> 02:39.860
we might stand a chance.

02:44.340 --> 02:45.900
The whistle is our code.

02:46.420 --> 02:47.340
You can use it

02:47.540 --> 02:48.460
to make our people

02:48.460 --> 02:49.300
to set traps for you.

02:49.980 --> 02:50.660
During the fight,

02:51.220 --> 02:52.260
use it to communicate.

02:54.020 --> 02:54.620
Thank you.

02:55.340 --> 02:56.140
Tie Ying is mine.

03:20.300 --> 03:21.620
Mere child's play.

05:08.620 --> 05:09.460
Jiu, when you kill,

05:10.140 --> 05:11.100
you have steady hands.

05:12.340 --> 05:13.500
But now, they shake.

05:16.220 --> 05:17.060
I failed to protect you.

05:18.060 --> 05:18.740
Don't mind.

05:19.620 --> 05:20.420
It matters to me.

05:23.220 --> 05:23.900
Before,

05:24.980 --> 05:25.660
it was an order.

05:27.220 --> 05:27.900
But now,

05:29.780 --> 05:30.460
it's my duty.

05:33.180 --> 05:33.900
And the future?

05:37.300 --> 05:38.140
In the future...

05:44.260 --> 05:44.740
We'll see.

05:50.460 --> 05:51.300
Whatever happens,

05:52.220 --> 05:53.340
I will protect you.

06:01.860 --> 06:02.700
Tie Ying retreated.

06:02.980 --> 06:03.940
Your father is safe now.

06:07.500 --> 06:08.180
Thank you, Ma'am.

06:15.060 --> 06:16.020
You helped a lot.

06:16.620 --> 06:17.460
To protect me,

06:18.340 --> 06:19.820
you suffered heavy losses.

06:22.020 --> 06:22.940
I don't know

06:24.220 --> 06:25.500
how I can repay you.

06:26.820 --> 06:28.540
Since we promised to protect you,

06:29.220 --> 06:30.300
we will keep our word.

06:31.260 --> 06:32.100
Tie Ying retreated.

06:32.460 --> 06:33.380
But more troops

06:33.380 --> 06:34.740
will be sent from Xiaonan.

06:36.900 --> 06:37.900
You'd better leave soon.

06:39.900 --> 06:40.500
Wait.

06:45.060 --> 06:46.340
My father gave this to me.

06:47.060 --> 06:47.900
When this is all over

06:48.180 --> 06:49.060
and I'm back in the Capital,

06:49.620 --> 06:50.220
you people

06:50.580 --> 06:51.620
can ask me for rewards

06:52.180 --> 06:53.100
with this jade pendant.

07:00.620 --> 07:01.020
All right.

07:12.540 --> 07:13.620
What a nice piece of jade.

07:22.940 --> 07:23.340
Come on.

07:23.860 --> 07:24.540
Take it.

07:32.420 --> 07:33.180
Eat some of this.

07:41.300 --> 07:42.260
Have you noticed

07:43.460 --> 07:44.500
the way she looks at you

07:45.220 --> 07:46.100
is a bit strange?

07:46.580 --> 07:47.420
She means no harm.

07:49.180 --> 07:50.260
But strange, indeed.

07:54.140 --> 07:54.980
I think Tie Ying

07:54.980 --> 07:56.100
has fled back to Xiaonan.

07:57.180 --> 07:58.620
Xiao Xun's men will come again.

07:59.060 --> 08:00.420
It's not wise to stay here long.

08:00.780 --> 08:01.220
Right.

08:02.300 --> 08:03.220
We'll leave soon.

08:09.780 --> 08:10.260
Ma'am,

08:10.700 --> 08:11.300
in that fight,

08:11.380 --> 08:12.420
we had three dead

08:12.700 --> 08:13.500
and seven badly injured.

08:13.780 --> 08:14.980
Three traps east were ruined

08:15.300 --> 08:16.140
and need to be reset.

08:16.940 --> 08:18.420
Have our men properly settled.

08:18.660 --> 08:19.940
Yes. I'm on it.

08:20.540 --> 08:20.980
Let's go.

08:31.220 --> 08:32.100
You're about to leave?

08:34.460 --> 08:35.700
Don't bother to say goodbye.

08:36.380 --> 08:37.340
And you have apologized.

08:38.020 --> 08:39.700
But I have one question.

08:41.500 --> 08:42.860
What exactly happened

08:43.900 --> 08:45.220
during my father's suppression?

08:47.300 --> 08:48.420
I told you, didn't I?

08:48.620 --> 08:49.180
I doubt it.

08:50.020 --> 08:50.980
I want the truth.

08:52.500 --> 08:53.140
This stronghold

08:53.140 --> 08:54.660
is totally my father's style.

08:56.060 --> 08:56.900
I don't believe

08:56.900 --> 08:58.340
it was just a misunderstanding.

08:59.260 --> 09:00.180
In that case,

09:00.940 --> 09:02.300
why did Mu Mianhong

09:02.980 --> 09:03.860
jump off a cliff

09:03.860 --> 09:05.020
instead of explaining?

09:12.940 --> 09:14.020
If you don't tell me,

09:15.460 --> 09:16.780
I might as well go

09:17.100 --> 09:17.740
ask my father.

09:24.980 --> 09:26.140
Do you know your father well?

09:27.100 --> 09:27.820
What kind of man

09:30.740 --> 09:31.820
do you think he is?

09:40.460 --> 09:41.420
My father...

09:43.260 --> 09:44.620
He's the God of War of our state

09:46.220 --> 09:48.140
and an all-powerful frontier hero.

09:49.180 --> 09:50.340
People respect him

09:51.500 --> 09:52.100
and revere him.

09:52.380 --> 09:53.620
Does that include you?

10:00.100 --> 10:01.460
Do you like this kind of father?

10:04.860 --> 10:05.500
No?

10:07.500 --> 10:08.020
Why?

10:15.100 --> 10:16.660
Because he's a hero to others.

10:19.260 --> 10:21.020
He's a hero to people in Yunzhong.

10:22.100 --> 10:23.420
He's a hero to the State of Chu.

10:24.620 --> 10:25.660
But I want him

10:26.180 --> 10:27.860
to be an ordinary father.

10:28.540 --> 10:29.980
Carve wooden dolls for me,

10:31.020 --> 10:32.300
watch fireworks with me,

10:34.140 --> 10:35.860
give me pretty braids,

10:37.860 --> 10:39.100
and be there with me

10:39.620 --> 10:41.260
for every important moment.

10:44.020 --> 10:44.900
But actually...

10:47.100 --> 10:47.980
None of this happened.

10:50.620 --> 10:51.180
What about...

10:54.860 --> 10:55.580
Your mother?

10:56.380 --> 10:57.060
My mother?

11:03.740 --> 11:05.460
I guess she's a great lady.

11:06.620 --> 11:07.700
According to my father,

11:08.740 --> 11:10.540
she's a perfect woman.

11:11.540 --> 11:12.660
She was well-learned

11:13.380 --> 11:15.300
and versed in all arts.

11:18.140 --> 11:19.380
Sadly, I didn't witness that.

11:21.980 --> 11:23.220
My mother died at a young age.

11:25.100 --> 11:26.260
For as long as I can remember,

11:27.140 --> 11:27.900
I have no memories

11:27.900 --> 11:29.220
of her.

11:30.860 --> 11:31.900
Sometimes I wish,

11:33.900 --> 11:35.580
if only my mother were alive.

11:36.420 --> 11:37.580
Then she would have stood up for me

11:37.580 --> 11:39.580
when Father scolded me.

11:40.380 --> 11:42.060
She would do my hair nicely.

11:42.500 --> 11:43.940
When people laughed at me

11:43.940 --> 11:45.420
for failing at everything,

11:47.220 --> 11:48.660
she would still treasure me

11:50.100 --> 11:51.300
and always protect me.

11:53.900 --> 11:54.860
But what a pity.

11:55.460 --> 11:56.260
My mother is gone.

11:57.580 --> 11:58.180
Sometimes,

11:58.180 --> 11:59.420
I blame myself.

12:01.060 --> 12:01.620
Why couldn't I

12:01.620 --> 12:02.940
remember everything

12:03.620 --> 12:04.900
when I was born?

12:05.740 --> 12:06.420
In that case,

12:08.380 --> 12:09.180
I would know

12:09.220 --> 12:10.540
what my mother looked like.

12:15.620 --> 12:16.940
My father claimed

12:17.340 --> 12:18.260
he loved my mother.

12:19.140 --> 12:20.380
But throughout our mansion,

12:21.500 --> 12:22.580
in the past 19 years,

12:23.060 --> 12:24.420
there has never been

12:24.540 --> 12:25.580
a single portrait of her.

12:27.620 --> 12:28.620
In your imagination,

12:31.140 --> 12:32.620
what does she look like?

12:36.140 --> 12:37.900
She's a noble lady,
according to my father.

12:39.660 --> 12:40.900
So she must have

12:41.820 --> 12:42.900
delicate eyebrows,

12:44.300 --> 12:45.340
bright eyes,

12:47.820 --> 12:49.260
and porcelain skin.

12:56.740 --> 12:57.340
Girl,

12:59.660 --> 13:01.060
whatever your mother looks like,

13:05.100 --> 13:06.060
your father loves you

13:07.580 --> 13:08.940
more than his own life.

13:11.060 --> 13:12.420
This has never changed.

13:23.020 --> 13:23.820
Zhao.

13:25.380 --> 13:26.980
How could you not know

13:27.420 --> 13:28.260
your letter

13:29.460 --> 13:30.660
would make him

13:30.660 --> 13:31.460
let down

13:32.260 --> 13:33.260
his guard?

13:34.740 --> 13:35.260
You're right.

13:40.980 --> 13:41.780
And that's enough.

13:54.460 --> 13:55.540
Your mother loves you too.

14:25.900 --> 14:26.620
Sorry,

14:27.260 --> 14:28.020
I failed.

14:28.500 --> 14:29.340
Please forgive me.

14:32.620 --> 14:33.820
Where are our men?

14:35.260 --> 14:36.500
The terrain there is eerie.

14:36.900 --> 14:38.020
Too many traps in the forest.

14:38.620 --> 14:39.540
We lost

14:40.380 --> 14:41.220
over half of our men.

14:43.500 --> 14:44.300
But I've figured out

14:44.300 --> 14:45.100
their defenses.

14:45.420 --> 14:46.660
I request another attack.

14:47.220 --> 14:48.420
Chu Zhao isn't stupid enough

14:48.460 --> 14:49.700
to wait there to die.

14:50.660 --> 14:52.020
She's eager to go back to Yunzhong.

14:52.540 --> 14:54.300
She won't stay long there.

14:54.900 --> 14:56.580
She has to pass through Wangcheng

14:57.340 --> 14:58.180
to get to Yunzhong.

14:58.860 --> 15:01.100
Since Cangmu Stronghold
is tough to invade,

15:03.260 --> 15:04.860
we'll be waiting for her further ahead.

15:05.900 --> 15:07.660
Cangmu Stronghold
lies at a key junction.

15:08.140 --> 15:09.420
If Chu Ling incorporates them,

15:10.260 --> 15:11.740
he will be more formidable.

15:14.900 --> 15:15.500
Tie Ying,

15:17.020 --> 15:17.900
send word to the Northern Desert.

15:19.500 --> 15:21.180
Tell them I want another deal

15:22.100 --> 15:23.300
with their king.

15:30.940 --> 15:31.820
Congratulations.

15:31.860 --> 15:32.780
You won again.

15:38.500 --> 15:39.260
Do you think

15:40.460 --> 15:41.460
Zhao

15:42.620 --> 15:43.700
will be in trouble?

15:44.220 --> 15:45.140
Don't worry. Your Majesty.

15:45.500 --> 15:46.660
Before Her Highness left,

15:46.700 --> 15:47.580
I divined for her.

15:47.860 --> 15:48.900
During the trip,

15:48.980 --> 15:50.140
she'll escape all misfortune.

15:52.780 --> 15:53.220
Your Majesty.

15:58.380 --> 15:59.140
Uncle,

15:59.380 --> 16:00.260
did you come so late

16:00.660 --> 16:01.780
because Zhao and Uncle Yanlai

16:01.780 --> 16:02.620
were in some trouble?

16:04.700 --> 16:06.260
Yanlai is skilled in martial arts.

16:06.700 --> 16:08.140
He'll protect Zhao.

16:08.380 --> 16:09.060
Don't worry.

16:09.900 --> 16:11.220
General Chu Ling

16:11.700 --> 16:13.420
killed the envoy without permission.

16:14.140 --> 16:15.140
It might lead to trouble.

16:15.980 --> 16:17.180
His old illness relapsed too.

16:17.740 --> 16:19.260
He might not survive this winter.

16:20.220 --> 16:21.460
In the court,

16:22.140 --> 16:23.060
the Grand Mentor said,

16:23.660 --> 16:25.020
if General Chu died,

16:25.500 --> 16:26.740
war would break out.

16:27.300 --> 16:28.460
So, our frontier forces

16:28.820 --> 16:29.980
should prepare early.

16:30.380 --> 16:31.300
Exactly.

16:32.380 --> 16:33.900
The 200,000 frontier troops in Yunzhong

16:34.260 --> 16:35.540
safeguard our state.

16:36.140 --> 16:37.540
If Northern Desert foes invade...

16:38.260 --> 16:38.780
Yu,

16:40.180 --> 16:41.620
do you dare to fight in battle?

16:42.340 --> 16:43.460
I will fight.

16:44.380 --> 16:46.260
We people never fear a battle.

16:47.620 --> 16:48.060
Good.

16:49.060 --> 16:50.100
Let me

16:51.020 --> 16:52.020
ask you one more thing.

16:52.820 --> 16:53.900
If Chu Ling dies,

16:54.580 --> 16:55.780
who should command

16:56.540 --> 16:58.300
the 200,000 frontier troops?

17:00.180 --> 17:00.980
Uncle Yanlai.

17:01.420 --> 17:02.460
He has great martial arts.

17:09.260 --> 17:09.980
Your Majesty,

17:10.500 --> 17:11.700
then get the edict ready.

17:12.420 --> 17:13.740
So we can plan ahead.

17:16.100 --> 17:17.100
Wait, Your Majesty.

17:21.820 --> 17:23.620
Mr. Xie, you're really impatient.

17:26.060 --> 17:26.580
Your Majesty,

17:27.580 --> 17:29.580
military affairs are of vital importance

17:30.060 --> 17:31.100
and need court discussion.

17:32.100 --> 17:34.340
Mr. Xie shouldn't have incited you
in private.

17:34.420 --> 17:34.940
Mr. Deng,

17:35.780 --> 17:37.620
are you trying to delay military action?

17:38.460 --> 17:39.500
I hold the Imperial Seal.

17:39.900 --> 17:41.060
Without the seal on it,

17:41.620 --> 17:42.780
this edict will be invalid.

17:44.020 --> 17:45.620
The Three Departments
approve troop deployment.

17:46.620 --> 17:48.660
It's time for you to end

17:49.660 --> 17:50.780
this practice of nepotism.

18:06.320 --> 18:09.100
[Northern Desert Army Camp]

18:17.580 --> 18:18.420
Word from Xiao Xun.

18:18.780 --> 18:19.940
Chu Ling is seriously sick.

18:20.180 --> 18:21.340
The Chu court is in chaos.

18:21.820 --> 18:24.020
He wants 3,000 elite soldiers of ours

18:24.380 --> 18:25.500
to bypass Xiaonan

18:25.700 --> 18:26.540
and go to Wangcheng

18:27.220 --> 18:29.140
to join the Xiaonan Army
in besieging Yunzhong.

18:29.380 --> 18:30.140
Then,

18:31.340 --> 18:32.340
we'll split his state.

18:34.340 --> 18:36.380
He's the most eager of all.

18:36.980 --> 18:38.940
After all these years as a hostage,

18:39.540 --> 18:41.380
he still hasn't become patient.

18:42.380 --> 18:44.100
Come on, Chu Ling.

18:45.700 --> 18:48.340
We've been fighting for two decades.

18:48.860 --> 18:51.380
The state you've guarded with your life

18:52.220 --> 18:54.100
corroded from within a long time ago.

18:58.940 --> 19:00.300
[Northern Desert King]

19:00.340 --> 19:02.220
Their ministers
scheme against each other.

19:02.820 --> 19:03.940
Even a hostage dares

19:05.900 --> 19:08.460
to collude with enemies for invasion.

19:12.860 --> 19:13.740
Now,

19:14.940 --> 19:16.340
it's our time

19:16.340 --> 19:17.980
to take over Yunzhong.

19:18.940 --> 19:19.940
But mountain defiles

19:20.180 --> 19:21.180
are perilous in Xiaonan.

19:21.580 --> 19:23.100
Supplies can't get through.​

19:23.620 --> 19:24.500
Wangcheng lies

19:25.100 --> 19:26.860
to the rear of Yunzhong.

19:28.580 --> 19:30.260
It's weakly guarded.

19:31.300 --> 19:32.660
We'll travel light

19:33.260 --> 19:34.380
for a night raid.

19:34.700 --> 19:35.780
Capturing it quickly

19:36.020 --> 19:36.860
won't be a problem.

19:42.180 --> 19:42.700
Go.

19:43.220 --> 19:44.340
Tell Xiao Xun.

19:44.740 --> 19:45.420
I will

19:46.500 --> 19:47.780
wait for him in Wangcheng.

20:00.580 --> 20:01.300
Son,

20:01.900 --> 20:03.820
we need to think carefully.

20:05.820 --> 20:07.740
The Northern Desert King is treacherous.

20:08.180 --> 20:09.220
To work with him

20:09.220 --> 20:11.100
is to play with fire.

20:11.940 --> 20:14.060
He has probed me for years,

20:14.220 --> 20:15.740
but I've never agreed.

20:15.740 --> 20:16.660
If we work with him,

20:16.740 --> 20:18.460
there may be unnecessary trouble.

20:20.260 --> 20:21.340
Can you guarantee

20:22.780 --> 20:24.620
that everything will be under control

20:25.100 --> 20:27.100
once his soldiers come in here?

20:29.500 --> 20:31.340
Without a perfect plan,

20:34.860 --> 20:36.380
we might as well wait.

20:37.820 --> 20:39.260
Father, I understand your concern.

20:40.300 --> 20:41.340
But in some cases,

20:42.820 --> 20:44.300
patience doesn't solve anything.

20:45.340 --> 20:45.980
I don't want

20:46.180 --> 20:47.620
to repeat the same mistakes.

20:49.620 --> 20:50.460
Chu Ling is badly ill.

20:51.660 --> 20:52.900
This is the perfect moment.

20:53.980 --> 20:55.060
We'll use our northern foes

20:56.180 --> 20:57.500
to support our own cause.

21:05.300 --> 21:06.580
I get it.

21:06.900 --> 21:08.660
Since you've made up your mind,

21:10.620 --> 21:11.660
go ahead and do it.

21:13.780 --> 21:14.860
Thank you, Father.

21:17.660 --> 21:19.140
I should send a few men

21:19.900 --> 21:20.740
to escort you.

21:22.020 --> 21:23.580
I've brought too much trouble to you.

21:24.140 --> 21:25.220
Many innocent people died.

21:26.420 --> 21:27.180
I will

21:27.740 --> 21:28.540
keep that in mind.

21:32.020 --> 21:33.300
You helped us at all costs.

21:33.660 --> 21:34.460
Whatever you want,

21:34.900 --> 21:35.620
just let me know.

21:37.220 --> 21:38.380
We want nothing from you.

21:39.700 --> 21:41.580
We just hope you won't forget us

21:41.820 --> 21:42.980
when you're back there

21:43.180 --> 21:44.260
and grant us some rewards.

21:44.940 --> 21:45.340
I will.

21:47.980 --> 21:48.740
That jade piece...

21:49.420 --> 21:50.580
Please keep it for me.

21:51.340 --> 21:51.780
Sure.

21:53.220 --> 21:54.420
Cangmu Forest isn't far

21:54.460 --> 21:55.300
from Wangcheng.

21:55.860 --> 21:56.780
Xiaonan's killers

21:56.780 --> 21:58.220
may pursue you, though.

21:58.940 --> 22:00.260
Every half day, Wangcheng soldiers

22:00.820 --> 22:02.420
patrol the foot of the mountain.

22:03.540 --> 22:04.660
Be more careful out there.

22:06.140 --> 22:07.220
Thank you for reminding me.

22:07.820 --> 22:08.740
We know what to do.

22:10.180 --> 22:10.740
That's good.

22:15.980 --> 22:16.420
Take care.

22:50.820 --> 22:51.940
You issued

22:52.540 --> 22:53.580
the transfer edict, right?

22:56.900 --> 22:57.900
Where did you

22:57.900 --> 22:58.860
get this?

22:59.780 --> 23:00.740
Theoretically,

23:00.900 --> 23:02.180
this edict should have

23:02.180 --> 23:03.460
left the Capital.

23:04.260 --> 23:05.980
Intercepting an imperial edict

23:06.500 --> 23:07.780
is a grave crime.

23:08.500 --> 23:09.420
I did intercept it.

23:14.540 --> 23:15.940
What does it mean?

23:20.420 --> 23:21.380
It means

23:22.300 --> 23:23.500
without my approval,

23:24.900 --> 23:26.660
it can't be issued.

23:26.900 --> 23:28.940
Do you think
I can't hold you accountable

23:29.420 --> 23:31.220
just because of who you are?

23:31.380 --> 23:32.340
You can do that.

23:33.380 --> 23:34.700
But I advise you not to do that.

23:35.660 --> 23:37.140
If we both lose in the end,

23:38.380 --> 23:39.580
our state will be in peril.

23:40.140 --> 23:41.100
Since you know that,

23:41.100 --> 23:42.980
why don't you advise yourself?

23:43.420 --> 23:45.500
You don't fear the peril of the state.

23:45.500 --> 23:46.860
Why would I be scared?

23:47.620 --> 23:48.580
So late at night,

23:48.580 --> 23:50.540
you visited His Majesty and coaxed him.

23:50.860 --> 23:52.660
Why can't I ease his burdens?

23:52.900 --> 23:54.300
Of course, you aren't afraid.

23:55.100 --> 23:56.340
But the way you ease burdens

23:57.420 --> 23:59.260
is a clear overreach of your authority.

24:00.340 --> 24:01.700
How dare you issue an edict

24:02.060 --> 24:03.780
without His Majesty's decision?

24:04.660 --> 24:06.180
Do you also want

24:07.140 --> 24:08.580
to sit on the throne

24:09.420 --> 24:10.820
to ease His Majesty's burdens?

24:12.020 --> 24:14.260
You overestimate me, Mr. Xie.

24:15.020 --> 24:17.340
His Majesty is aware of all this.

24:18.300 --> 24:19.180
As for you...

24:19.700 --> 24:20.660
Do you really think

24:20.660 --> 24:22.220
Chu Ling's defeat of an enemy army

24:22.220 --> 24:23.860
will bring peace?

24:24.980 --> 24:26.980
Once Chu Ling dies a sudden death,

24:26.980 --> 24:28.900
Yunzhong troops will fall into chaos.

24:29.660 --> 24:31.780
Then our state will be in real peril.

24:32.900 --> 24:33.820
Others might not know.​

24:34.060 --> 24:35.260
But we both know

24:35.740 --> 24:37.420
what the Lord of Xiaonan will do

24:37.620 --> 24:39.420
when Yunzhong is in chaos.

24:39.620 --> 24:41.300
What will the Lord of Xiaonan do?

24:43.700 --> 24:45.700
You know it perfectly well, don't you?

24:46.580 --> 24:48.180
Back then, you insisted

24:48.340 --> 24:49.540
Xiao Xun return to Xiaonan.

24:50.260 --> 24:51.260
When the hostage left,

24:51.780 --> 24:53.580
you should have foreseen this day.

24:53.940 --> 24:54.820
Xie Yanfang!

24:56.380 --> 24:57.260
Your duty is merely

24:57.260 --> 24:58.780
to enforce edicts.

24:59.420 --> 25:00.580
You have no say

25:00.580 --> 25:01.500
in military affairs.

25:01.540 --> 25:03.100
This is a real overreach of authority!

25:17.580 --> 25:19.180
Here's the Grand Princess Token.

25:20.340 --> 25:21.540
I'm exercising the veto power

25:22.460 --> 25:23.900
on behalf of Her Highness.

25:39.780 --> 25:40.540
Madam Ge said,

25:40.940 --> 25:41.980
Wangcheng soldiers

25:41.980 --> 25:42.980
patrol at this hour.

25:43.260 --> 25:44.100
She's right.

25:45.940 --> 25:46.540
So,

25:47.380 --> 25:48.620
what exactly

25:48.860 --> 25:49.700
is your great plan?

25:50.340 --> 25:51.460
We'll "surrender".

25:53.860 --> 25:54.660
Are you saying

25:55.660 --> 25:56.380
we'll deliberately

25:56.380 --> 25:57.660
let these patrols catch us

25:58.300 --> 25:59.180
and take us to Wangcheng?

25:59.860 --> 26:01.140
So, Mr. Xie,

26:01.500 --> 26:03.220
show some mercy in the fight.

26:05.420 --> 26:06.100
Who are you?

26:08.900 --> 26:09.580
I don't think

26:10.820 --> 26:11.740
there'll be a fight.

26:16.140 --> 26:17.140
It's him.

26:22.100 --> 26:23.260
In my past life,

26:23.860 --> 26:25.940
he was a vanguard
under my father's command.

26:26.140 --> 26:28.420
But now, he seems to be

26:29.340 --> 26:30.060
a foot soldier

26:30.060 --> 26:32.060
among Wangcheng troops.

26:33.340 --> 26:34.140
Liang Qiang.

26:38.100 --> 26:39.020
How do you know my name?

26:39.500 --> 26:40.940
Mr. Xie, you don't allow me

26:40.940 --> 26:42.140
to dispatch new generals.

26:43.540 --> 26:45.580
And you seem to have decent excuses.

26:46.140 --> 26:47.460
Actually, it's just because

26:47.460 --> 26:48.660
they are not loyal to you.

26:49.380 --> 26:50.380
Then do you think

26:51.540 --> 26:52.780
you can plant your own men

26:53.540 --> 26:55.460
after you stop me?

26:56.100 --> 26:57.500
You don't trust me.

26:59.260 --> 27:00.620
I don't trust you either.

27:02.020 --> 27:02.620
So we should

27:02.620 --> 27:03.860
place our trust in Chu Ling.

27:04.900 --> 27:06.340
We must believe he will

27:06.340 --> 27:07.620
handle everything before he dies.

27:08.220 --> 27:09.340
Chaos won't occur.

27:10.060 --> 27:12.060
Northern Desert foes won't invade.

27:14.020 --> 27:16.620
Once our state is in crisis,
we'll be in danger.

27:17.620 --> 27:18.900
So will Chu Ling.

27:20.020 --> 27:20.860
If our state falls,

27:21.100 --> 27:22.220
as the Grand Princess,

27:22.220 --> 27:23.740
her daughter will die too.

27:24.140 --> 27:26.220
Chu Ling won't let her daughter

27:26.620 --> 27:28.180
fall into danger.

27:33.540 --> 27:34.140
Fine.

27:36.300 --> 27:37.900
Since the generals

27:37.900 --> 27:38.780
can't go to Yunzhong,

27:39.900 --> 27:40.700
Mr. Xie,

27:43.700 --> 27:45.740
your private troops

27:46.220 --> 27:48.340
must not go there too.

27:54.900 --> 27:55.620
I read the files

27:55.620 --> 27:57.060
on your father's connection

27:57.460 --> 27:58.020
to the Third Prince.

28:02.140 --> 28:03.220
Who are you?

28:05.540 --> 28:06.540
The Third Prince was executed.

28:06.980 --> 28:08.260
His subordinates were demoted.

28:08.940 --> 28:10.100
Your family collapsed.

28:10.500 --> 28:12.260
You became a patrol soldier then.

28:12.540 --> 28:13.300
Would you really

28:13.300 --> 28:15.340
waste your life
in the middle of nowhere?

28:17.180 --> 28:18.060
Who on earth are you?

28:18.540 --> 28:19.420
I'm here to help.

28:20.820 --> 28:21.860
We're merely bandits

28:21.980 --> 28:23.660
who have fled from Cangmu Stronghold.

28:24.780 --> 28:25.820
You patrolled here

28:25.860 --> 28:26.740
and ran into bandits.

28:27.260 --> 28:28.260
If you take us back,

28:28.540 --> 28:29.740
you'll make great merit.

28:30.060 --> 28:31.580
We just switched allegiance.

28:31.740 --> 28:32.820
Don't be suspicious.

28:33.660 --> 28:35.020
You just need to decide

28:35.900 --> 28:36.660
whether you want

28:37.340 --> 28:38.540
that credit.

28:39.460 --> 28:40.340
Back in Wangcheng,

28:41.060 --> 28:42.220
if you dare to play tricks,

28:42.980 --> 28:44.260
I'll kill you immediately.

28:44.500 --> 28:46.140
Since you accept this merit,

28:46.660 --> 28:47.260
we will

28:47.740 --> 28:48.780
behave ourselves.

28:54.420 --> 28:55.020
Mr. Xie,

28:57.740 --> 28:59.500
where is your brother

29:00.020 --> 29:01.060
planning to take

29:01.060 --> 29:02.180
the Grand Princess?

29:06.500 --> 29:08.700
My brother has been suspended.

29:09.180 --> 29:10.420
Her Highness is recuperating.

29:11.180 --> 29:12.580
I don't know what you mean.

29:13.340 --> 29:14.860
Then let me remind you.

29:15.780 --> 29:17.820
He who holds the emperor
commands the lords.

29:18.460 --> 29:19.900
But he who holds the Grand Princess

29:20.740 --> 29:22.580
only commands Chu Ling.

29:23.220 --> 29:24.660
It's a bad bargain.

29:24.660 --> 29:26.060
You know that perfectly well.

29:26.140 --> 29:27.820
Then you should also know.

29:29.620 --> 29:31.340
Chu Zhao must not die.

29:32.260 --> 29:34.100
She must stay alive.

29:34.780 --> 29:35.620
Only when she's alive

29:36.460 --> 29:37.300
will the court avoid

29:37.300 --> 29:38.620
another rebellion.

29:39.260 --> 29:40.500
Then our game

29:41.180 --> 29:43.060
can keep going, right?

29:44.020 --> 29:45.020
In that case,

29:46.060 --> 29:47.500
hope your ninth brother

29:47.580 --> 29:48.700
will protect Her Highness well

29:50.140 --> 29:52.340
as we all expect him to.

29:56.220 --> 29:57.660
Of course.

30:01.420 --> 30:03.260
But you're wrong about one thing.

30:05.380 --> 30:06.460
My brother didn't take

30:06.460 --> 30:07.500
away the Grand Princess.

30:08.140 --> 30:09.420
Instead, the Grand Princess

30:10.140 --> 30:11.860
took away my brother.

30:19.540 --> 30:21.500
Mr. Deng, you're pretty bold.

30:25.020 --> 30:26.340
You removed the coffin

30:26.900 --> 30:27.980
bestowed by Her Highness.

30:28.900 --> 30:31.060
Her Highness withdrew from the court.

30:31.580 --> 30:33.220
Why can't I move this little thing then?

30:47.340 --> 30:48.260
Impressive.

30:48.700 --> 30:49.420
Let me try.

30:56.220 --> 30:56.860
Hello, Miss Qi.

30:56.980 --> 30:57.860
Hello, Lady Tang.

31:04.860 --> 31:06.660
That totally ruined my mood.

31:07.340 --> 31:08.420
What are you talking about?

31:08.540 --> 31:09.380
What did we do?

31:09.940 --> 31:11.020
Is it because

31:11.020 --> 31:13.100
we didn't bow to Miss Chu Tang?

31:13.580 --> 31:14.980
You should be straightforward.

31:15.340 --> 31:16.540
Why do you bother

31:16.740 --> 31:17.740
to be so sarcastic?

31:17.940 --> 31:18.620
All right.

31:22.100 --> 31:24.300
Lady Tang, let me ask you.

31:24.660 --> 31:25.980
Do you know

31:25.980 --> 31:27.300
if your uncle General Chu Ling

31:27.300 --> 31:28.620
fails to defend the frontier,

31:28.980 --> 31:30.540
people will suffer?

31:34.980 --> 31:35.620
I know.

31:36.420 --> 31:37.620
You speak recklessly

31:38.140 --> 31:40.180
because you worry
about our state and people.

31:40.460 --> 31:41.180
This is good.

31:41.940 --> 31:43.060
Unmarried ladies like us

31:43.060 --> 31:44.300
should pay more attention

31:44.300 --> 31:45.180
to state affairs.

31:45.500 --> 31:45.940
Only then

31:46.220 --> 31:48.100
will we know about the hardships

31:48.180 --> 31:49.140
of our state and people.

31:49.700 --> 31:50.220
However,

31:50.700 --> 31:52.340
we must not judge by appearances

31:52.580 --> 31:54.220
or take a part for the whole.

31:54.500 --> 31:55.580
We didn't speak recklessly.

31:56.140 --> 31:57.780
What we said is the truth.

31:57.820 --> 31:58.700
What is truth?

31:58.700 --> 31:59.660
What you see is truth.

31:59.820 --> 32:01.340
Did you see with your own eyes

32:01.460 --> 32:02.380
that my uncle failed

32:02.940 --> 32:04.460
and our foes gained an advantage?

32:04.860 --> 32:05.980
Don't try to deny it.

32:09.060 --> 32:10.020
Do you know how big

32:10.020 --> 32:10.620
Yunzhong is?

32:10.900 --> 32:12.340
Do you know how many soldiers

32:12.340 --> 32:13.340
are involved in a battle?

32:13.540 --> 32:14.820
Do you know how many people

32:15.020 --> 32:16.260
from the Northern Desert

32:16.460 --> 32:17.700
have come to travel

32:18.020 --> 32:19.180
on the trade routes

32:19.180 --> 32:19.820
of our state?

32:20.460 --> 32:22.220
When the case is investigated,

32:22.940 --> 32:25.340
my uncle will be
convicted or vindicated.

32:25.860 --> 32:26.860
But now,

32:27.700 --> 32:29.500
no one can convict him without proof.

32:31.340 --> 32:33.180
Once war breaks out,
situations are volatile

32:33.540 --> 32:34.420
and intricate.

32:35.260 --> 32:36.260
Even the Emperor's orders

32:36.300 --> 32:37.380
aren't always followed.

32:38.540 --> 32:39.940
And you don't even know

32:39.940 --> 32:41.540
what exactly happened in Yunzhong.

32:41.900 --> 32:43.300
How can you parrot what others say?

32:44.260 --> 32:44.700
Let's go.

32:48.220 --> 32:48.980
Come on.

32:50.740 --> 32:51.420
Tang.

32:52.180 --> 32:52.620
I...

32:58.020 --> 32:58.580
I'm sorry.

32:59.260 --> 33:00.220
Miss Chu, you seem

33:00.220 --> 33:01.260
to be in good spirits.

33:02.260 --> 33:04.020
Your family is in turmoil.

33:04.300 --> 33:05.580
But you're in the mood for tea.

33:06.580 --> 33:08.140
If you're here for some fun,

33:08.180 --> 33:08.860
get in there.

33:09.100 --> 33:10.500
More fun with the storyteller.

33:10.980 --> 33:11.500
Tang,

33:11.780 --> 33:13.140
how can you be so rude to Mr. Deng?

33:14.140 --> 33:15.420
He wanted to watch the fun,

33:15.580 --> 33:16.980
then I recommended the opera house.

33:16.980 --> 33:17.900
How was that rude?​

33:18.100 --> 33:19.140
Has my entire family

33:19.140 --> 33:20.020
already been convicted

33:20.020 --> 33:21.020
that I can't even speak?

33:21.140 --> 33:21.860
You can speak.

33:22.660 --> 33:24.420
Lady Tang, your frankness

33:24.620 --> 33:25.540
is quite admirable.

33:26.100 --> 33:26.900
Even if your uncle

33:26.900 --> 33:27.860
ends up guilty,

33:27.940 --> 33:29.100
the Grand Princess

33:29.100 --> 33:29.980
will stand by you.

33:31.740 --> 33:33.220
You've got a point there, Mr. Deng.

33:33.460 --> 33:33.940
Farewell.

33:38.100 --> 33:39.700
Tang, wait for me.

33:46.140 --> 33:46.820
Oh no.

33:47.380 --> 33:48.020
What was I

33:48.020 --> 33:49.340
even saying?

33:49.660 --> 33:50.380
Yeah.

33:51.100 --> 33:51.860
Scared now, huh?

33:53.020 --> 33:54.820
What happened to all that swagger?

33:55.900 --> 33:56.580
Come on.

33:56.780 --> 33:57.780
Don't tease me.

33:58.220 --> 33:59.340
Just now,

33:59.820 --> 34:00.980
I lost my temper.

34:01.100 --> 34:02.260
I couldn't remember

34:02.260 --> 34:03.900
what I said or did.

34:05.300 --> 34:06.660
Now I've come to my senses.

34:08.180 --> 34:09.860
I'm so terrified.

34:14.900 --> 34:15.980
Anyway, what's gone is gone.

34:16.860 --> 34:17.820
Even if I said that,

34:18.540 --> 34:19.900
who would dare to do anything?

34:20.860 --> 34:21.620
Tang,

34:23.340 --> 34:25.980
you've changed.

34:27.780 --> 34:29.580
You never argued with anyone before.

34:30.300 --> 34:31.100
Not to mention

34:31.180 --> 34:32.660
arguing for General Chu and Chu Zhao.

34:37.060 --> 34:38.340
Oh, my uncle.

34:39.260 --> 34:40.860
Please don't get convicted.

34:42.340 --> 34:43.220
And Zhao...

34:43.460 --> 34:44.860
Come back early.

34:53.020 --> 34:55.060
Before fully recovering,

34:55.620 --> 34:56.740
you exhausted yourself again.

34:57.620 --> 34:58.500
I know what I'm doing.

35:02.260 --> 35:03.340
Can we trust this man?

35:03.900 --> 35:05.420
Liang Qiang is low-ranking,

35:05.740 --> 35:06.900
but he's a regular soldier.

35:07.540 --> 35:08.420
Xiao Xun's troops

35:08.420 --> 35:09.980
won't provoke or inspect him.

35:10.620 --> 35:11.140
In this way,

35:11.540 --> 35:12.660
we'll be able to avoid

35:12.660 --> 35:13.620
Xiao Xun's spies.

35:14.380 --> 35:14.900
Besides,

35:16.060 --> 35:17.340
we're taking a carriage now.

35:17.660 --> 35:19.180
No soft cushions or pillows.

35:19.260 --> 35:19.940
But at least,

35:20.140 --> 35:21.460
we don't need to trek.

35:22.020 --> 35:22.500
How nice.

35:22.820 --> 35:23.540
Two birds, one stone.

35:27.340 --> 35:32.940
[Wangcheng]

35:40.100 --> 35:40.900
Get them down.

36:10.340 --> 36:11.300
The ruts are weird.

36:12.020 --> 36:13.060
It seems to be a straw cart

36:13.060 --> 36:13.900
heading for town.

36:16.220 --> 36:18.100
The straw binding is loose.

36:18.780 --> 36:20.220
Usually, a loosely bound cart bears

36:20.540 --> 36:22.260
no more than three to five hundred jin.

36:23.340 --> 36:25.340
But the ruts are deeper
than half a finger.

36:25.860 --> 36:26.940
It carries at least

36:28.180 --> 36:28.740
800 jin.

36:29.460 --> 36:30.980
There's something else in the cart.

36:34.580 --> 36:35.740
Judging from the ruts,

36:36.140 --> 36:37.460
no fewer than ten carts

36:38.700 --> 36:39.660
have entered town today.

36:40.340 --> 36:41.860
Someone's taking so much trouble

36:42.580 --> 36:43.980
to do something to this town.

36:44.500 --> 36:45.820
This is a strategic frontier town.

36:46.620 --> 36:47.820
If it falls,

36:48.300 --> 36:49.100
Yunzhong Prefecture

36:49.580 --> 36:50.980
will be attacked
from the front and rear.

36:52.660 --> 36:54.460
Xiao Xun sent his men in disguise.

36:55.540 --> 36:56.700
But the gate guards

36:56.740 --> 36:57.700
should have inspected

36:57.980 --> 36:59.540
either disguised men or hidden weapons.

36:59.940 --> 37:01.380
By Article ten of the Frontier Code,

37:02.020 --> 37:03.780
a Military Supply Token will exempt

37:04.340 --> 37:05.740
all goods from inspection.

37:06.580 --> 37:07.540
Given Xiao Xun's status,

37:07.740 --> 37:08.780
getting some tokens

37:09.820 --> 37:10.660
would be quite easy.

37:12.540 --> 37:13.300
Follow me in.

37:14.540 --> 37:15.220
You go back now.

37:17.260 --> 37:17.700
Keep up.

37:24.540 --> 37:24.980
Your Highness,

37:25.620 --> 37:26.660
3,000 elite troops of Northern Desert

37:26.900 --> 37:27.740
passed Xinggu Pass

37:28.140 --> 37:28.860
and reached Shalang Col,

37:28.860 --> 37:29.860
less than 100 li from Wangcheng.

37:31.820 --> 37:33.340
Tell them to go along the official road

37:34.780 --> 37:36.660
with the travel permit,
disguised as caravans.

37:37.340 --> 37:38.820
Make sure they're well provisioned.

37:40.100 --> 37:40.540
Yes.

37:40.980 --> 37:42.620
We won't dispatch troops

37:44.180 --> 37:45.220
until they take Wangcheng.

37:47.540 --> 37:47.940
Ge.

37:48.340 --> 37:48.740
Ge.

37:49.020 --> 37:49.580
Bad news.

37:51.020 --> 37:51.860
Our scout spotted

37:52.220 --> 37:53.060
3,000 soldiers headed

37:53.140 --> 37:53.820
for Wangcheng

37:54.060 --> 37:55.660
from the official road northwest
toward Xiaonan,

37:55.860 --> 37:56.940
disguised as caravans.

37:57.460 --> 37:58.740
From Xiaonan?

38:00.300 --> 38:02.260
Wangcheng is vital
to the rear of Yunzhong.

38:03.220 --> 38:04.020
Once it falls,

38:04.660 --> 38:05.980
Xiao Xun will block supplies

38:05.980 --> 38:07.220
within half a day.

38:08.220 --> 38:09.460
By then, the Yunzhong troops

38:09.500 --> 38:10.700
will be besieged

38:11.220 --> 38:12.020
with no supplies.

38:12.900 --> 38:13.740
Massive soldiers

38:13.740 --> 38:15.260
will be desperately trapped.

38:17.540 --> 38:18.060
Oh no.

38:18.980 --> 38:20.260
At the rate of traveling,

38:21.660 --> 38:23.140
the two of them are just at Wangcheng.

38:26.900 --> 38:27.460
General,

38:27.900 --> 38:28.980
in Cangmu Forest, I caught

38:29.260 --> 38:30.660
two bandits of Cangmu Stronghold.

38:31.380 --> 38:33.100
Bandits have done countless crimes.

38:33.620 --> 38:34.340
Execute them now.

38:36.420 --> 38:38.020
General, it's easy for you to kill us.

38:38.420 --> 38:39.140
But I wonder

38:39.300 --> 38:40.700
if you can remain so decisive

38:41.140 --> 38:41.900
when northern foes

38:41.940 --> 38:43.020
break into town.

38:49.300 --> 38:51.020
How dare you!

38:51.620 --> 38:53.420
How could you spread a fallacy here?

38:53.820 --> 38:55.020
If we were real bandits,

38:55.420 --> 38:56.460
why would we come voluntarily?

38:57.340 --> 38:58.100
As we entered town,

38:58.380 --> 38:59.980
we spotted enemy spies in disguise.

39:00.700 --> 39:01.980
The ruts of straw carts

39:01.980 --> 39:02.940
are abnormally deep.

39:03.340 --> 39:04.460
Weapons must be hidden there.

39:05.020 --> 39:05.740
Now,

39:05.860 --> 39:07.220
instead of executing me,

39:07.940 --> 39:08.780
you should send men

39:08.900 --> 39:10.220
to close the city gate,

39:10.660 --> 39:11.500
search the city,

39:11.580 --> 39:12.380
and increase security.

39:12.580 --> 39:13.380
Shut up!

39:16.140 --> 39:16.980
How dare a bandit

39:17.020 --> 39:18.780
comment on military affairs,

39:18.860 --> 39:20.900
stir up unrest, and shake troop morale?

39:21.300 --> 39:23.100
I'll chop your heads off now

39:23.220 --> 39:25.220
and hang them
on the city wall as a warning!

39:25.660 --> 39:26.300
Kill them!

39:40.100 --> 39:41.180
Brilliant plan.

39:41.500 --> 39:42.660
Xiao Xun didn't kill you.

39:43.140 --> 39:43.740
But someone

39:43.740 --> 39:44.660
on your own side will.

39:45.180 --> 39:45.900
You're wrong.

39:46.620 --> 39:47.380
You've been

39:47.740 --> 39:48.540
the only one

39:48.860 --> 39:49.660
on my own side.

39:51.820 --> 39:52.500
Outrageous.

39:52.700 --> 39:53.380
Outrageous!

39:53.740 --> 39:54.860
Seize them immediately

39:54.980 --> 39:56.140
and execute them!

39:56.820 --> 39:57.660
Don't you dare!

40:05.580 --> 40:07.780
Zhong Changrong,
deputy of the Guard General,

40:07.940 --> 40:09.740
is here to see the Grand Princess!

40:46.580 --> 40:47.140
Hey, girl.

40:49.660 --> 40:50.260
Girl.

41:17.940 --> 41:18.380
Hey.

41:22.420 --> 41:22.900
Hey.

41:23.820 --> 41:24.700
It's been years.

41:25.540 --> 41:26.740
Don't you recognize me?

41:30.460 --> 41:31.220
Mr. Zhong.

41:32.020 --> 41:33.580
Did anyone bully you?

41:37.980 --> 41:38.500
You...

41:39.500 --> 41:40.220
You vile creature!

41:40.380 --> 41:41.660
Are you blind?

41:42.020 --> 41:43.580
This is General Chu's daughter,

41:43.580 --> 41:44.740
the Grand Princess.

41:45.300 --> 41:46.540
Just now,

41:46.700 --> 41:48.900
who were you going to execute?

41:51.620 --> 41:52.100
Sorry,

41:52.340 --> 41:53.220
I misjudged you.

41:53.300 --> 41:54.660
Mercy, Your Highness.

41:56.740 --> 41:57.500
My eyes failed me

41:57.980 --> 41:59.220
and I offended Your Highness.

41:59.660 --> 42:00.700
Please forgive me.

42:01.700 --> 42:02.460
Not your fault.

42:03.380 --> 42:05.020
Your priority is to close the city gate

42:05.140 --> 42:05.820
and defend deep.

42:06.500 --> 42:08.060
Find out Northern Desert foes

42:08.180 --> 42:08.860
and weapons.

42:10.180 --> 42:10.700
I swear

42:11.140 --> 42:11.980
to hold the city.

42:13.580 --> 42:14.140
Mr. Zhao,

42:14.620 --> 42:15.540
your official headwear

42:15.740 --> 42:16.580
is still yours now.

42:17.540 --> 42:18.780
But if this city falls,

42:19.460 --> 42:20.660
you will lose it

42:21.260 --> 42:22.020
and your life.

42:22.540 --> 42:25.220
I swear to stand and fall with the city!

42:25.580 --> 42:26.580
Leave us right now.

42:26.740 --> 42:27.340
Get to work.

42:34.420 --> 42:34.940
Mr. Zhong,

42:35.300 --> 42:35.940
why are you here?

42:38.140 --> 42:39.620
Your father was worried about you,

42:39.700 --> 42:40.660
so he sent me here

42:40.740 --> 42:41.940
to get you back to Yunzhong.

42:42.260 --> 42:43.340
When I was halfway,

42:43.980 --> 42:44.980
I got this man's message,

42:45.700 --> 42:47.340
saying you would reach Wangcheng.

42:48.260 --> 42:50.060
I traveled hundreds of li for nothing

42:50.060 --> 42:51.620
and rushed back immediately.

42:52.220 --> 42:53.140
You arrived later

42:53.140 --> 42:53.940
than I expected.

42:54.300 --> 42:54.780
Zhong,

42:55.260 --> 42:56.980
you should work on your speed.

42:58.140 --> 42:59.300
How rude.

42:59.420 --> 42:59.980
Nonsense.

43:02.140 --> 43:03.220
Report!

43:04.620 --> 43:05.940
Scouts have spotted

43:06.340 --> 43:07.380
3,000 enemy troops

43:07.460 --> 43:08.260
came from the north.

43:08.420 --> 43:09.820
They're within 50 li of this city.

43:18.060 --> 43:22.660
♪Broken walls and withered branches,
trapped in the mire♪

43:22.940 --> 43:25.420
♪Yet still striving
to reach for the sky♪

43:25.460 --> 43:29.500
♪My pride is torn down
and my body is sacrificed♪

43:31.740 --> 43:33.860
♪The spark smolders in the crack♪

43:33.940 --> 43:35.900
♪And roars in the blaze♪

43:35.980 --> 43:39.220
♪Burning the cold night until daybreak♪

43:39.380 --> 43:41.620
♪Fate imprisons me♪

43:41.780 --> 43:46.580
♪But I won't beg the abyss for mercy♪

43:46.580 --> 43:50.780
♪Even if hope is faint,
I remain proud♪

43:50.780 --> 43:55.060
♪A mayfly will cross the ocean,
however long it takes♪

43:55.060 --> 44:00.500
♪However it ends up,
I'll go my own way♪

44:00.500 --> 44:02.460
♪With no fear of the distance♪

44:02.460 --> 44:06.180
♪Born from decay, fireflies still burn♪

44:06.180 --> 44:10.620
♪With sword in hand,
I'll pierce the dawn♪

44:10.620 --> 44:15.980
♪Let these scars all over me become♪

44:15.980 --> 44:19.580
♪My new pride♪

44:34.380 --> 44:37.260
♪Peril is everywhere in the palace♪

44:37.260 --> 44:39.780
♪Yet I smile to nobody but you♪

44:39.780 --> 44:42.140
♪Amidst the chaos♪

44:42.140 --> 44:46.420
♪I'll always be with you♪

44:47.860 --> 44:49.980
♪The spark smolders in the crack♪

44:50.060 --> 44:52.020
♪And roars in the blaze♪

44:52.100 --> 44:55.340
♪Burning the cold night until daybreak♪

44:55.500 --> 44:57.740
♪Fate imprisons me♪

44:57.900 --> 45:02.700
♪But I won't beg the abyss for mercy♪

45:02.700 --> 45:06.900
♪Even if hope is faint,
I remain proud♪

45:06.900 --> 45:11.180
♪A mayfly will cross the ocean,
however long it takes♪

45:11.180 --> 45:16.620
♪However it ends up,
I'll go my own way♪

45:16.620 --> 45:18.580
♪With no fear of the distance♪

45:18.580 --> 45:22.300
♪Born from decay, fireflies still burn♪

45:22.300 --> 45:26.740
♪With sword in hand,
I'll pierce the dawn♪

45:26.740 --> 45:32.100
♪Let these scars all over me become♪

45:32.100 --> 45:35.700
♪My new pride♪
